    {
      "Text": "Security update for openssh",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for openssh fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-73282: unsynchronized remote forwarding updates in SSH client multiplexing can cause use-after-free\n  (bsc#1275074).\n- CVE-2026-73283: unenforced restriction keywords on tunnel forwarding can allow administrative security policy bypasses\n  (bsc#1275079).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
